<title>USA: Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</title>
<headline>Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Placements of broiler chicks in the 15 major producing states in the week ended Feb 15 totalled 135.970 million, versus a revised 133.239 million in the previous week and 131.709 million a year ago, the U.S. Agriculture Department said.</p>
<p>Eggs set in those states in the same week totalled 171.715 million, versus a revised 172.488 million the previous week and 168.695 million in the comparable week of last year, USDA said.</p>
</text>
